 Benefits for work-related injuries and illnesses  | 1-800-736-7401\nL232: Office of the Director  | Any other topic related to the Department of Industrial Relations  | 844-522-6734\nL233: ## Bilingual Services Complaint Process\nL234: \nL235: DIR is committed to providing equal access to all our programs and services for persons with limited English-speaking skills. If you are not satisfied with the bilingual services you have received with DIR, you may file a complaint by sending an email to DIO@dir.ca.gov.\nL236: \nL237: [Button: Close]\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRecent Actions (https://www.aqmd.gov/home/rules-compliance/rules/recent-actions)\nciteturn794view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.aqmd.gov/home/rules-compliance/rules/recent-actions\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 426\nL0: [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input]\nL1: \nL2: [Input] [Input]\nL3: \nL4: [Input] cite0†Skip to main content L5: \nL6:   * cite1†About L7:     * cite1†About Overview L8:     * cite2†Governing Board L9:     * cite3†Authority L10:     * cite4†Executive Management L11:     * cite5†Finance L12:     * cite6†Frequently Asked Questions L13:     * cite7†Goals & Priority Objectives L14:     * cite8†Hearing Board L15:     * cite9†Groups & Committees L16:     * cite10†Initiatives L17:     * cite11†Policies & Legal Requirements L18:     * cite12†Public Information Center L19:     * cite13†Public Notices L20:     * cite14†Salary Information L21: \nL22:   * cite15†F.I.N.D. L23:     * cite15†F.I.N.D. Overview L24:     * cite16†Facility INformation Detail (F.I.N.D.) L25:     * cite17†Limitations L26:     * cite18†Information Available L27:     * cite19†How to Search L28:     * cite20†Other Tools L29: \nL30:   *   * cite21†Online Services L31:     * cite21†Online Services Overview L32:     * cite22†